WEBVTT

NOTE Narration by an AI voice: Matilda (XrExE9yKIg1WjnnlVkGX), eleven_v4.

intro
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:07.420
Here, Cursor CLI writes a first Splunk agent with the Agentic SDK, in about 30 lines.

ask
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:14.600
The prompt asks for a script that can only look up indexes and run a search.

setup
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.360
It should find which index holds the checkout logs, and how many events it has.

skills
00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:30.720
Cursor loads the Agentic SDK skill, so it follows Splunk's pattern instead of guessing.

env
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:36.480
It checks that Splunk and Gemini credentials are set, without printing the values.

imports
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:43.640
Then it confirms the SDK imports, and writes a short script.

allowlist
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.840
The script allowlists two Splunk MCP tools.

run
00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:54.960
Cursor runs the agent. Gemini looks up the checkout index on the live stack.

answer
00:00:55.300 --> 00:01:00.420
That's demo_checkout, about 86,000 events.

rerun
00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:03.680
Now you run the same script yourself.

outro
00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:08.000
One prompt, and a working Splunk agent.
